    "note": "Owner decisions 2026-11-11: a round stopped by a plate knocks the man down for a few seconds and leaves a minor blunt injury (pain, no bleeding). Severity scales gently with the bullet's remaining energy relative to 1000 J (power 0.3). Most wounds bleed far below the zone's worst case (floor 12 %, rising with the cube of a random draw): few hit a major vessel. A round that strikes an arm from the side goes on into the trunk 6 times in 10 with 70 % of its energy. Fragments: one below 3 J does not wound; severity grows with the square root of its energy relative to 50 J. Blast: lung and ear injury, severity 0.2 at the edge of the injury radius rising to 0.75 at the severe radius."
